                            <layoutDesc>
                                <layout>
                                    <p>Complex relief plaque: upper area has bust of Men with solar crown, crescent, eight-pointed stars. Central area framed by torches with bull's head (central eye), two-headed snake as balance, cornucopia, quiver, Pan pipes, pruning hook, Dioscuri caps, wheel (Nemesis?), tongs, winged mirror. Bottom area with caduceus, animals, waterbird, lion, and scattered crescents.</p>
                                    <rs ref="http://www.eagle-network.eu/voc/writing/lod/1">incisa a scalpello</rs>
